From: stripeyhorse <stripeyhorse@local>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:38:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] GAME_PORTING_GUIDE: raw SPURS policy modules;
 mandatory-install pre-seed

Two recipes earned during a retail port's bring-up:

- Raw SPURS policy modules: how to recognise the 'PM NOT LIFTED'
  retry loop, carve the raw image at the logged guest address, wrap it
  at the PM load base (LS 0xA00 -- the marker words at the image start
  are executable no-ops), lift, and register it in the fingerprint
  registry cellSpurs consults (not the job-module overlay path).

- Mandatory first-boot installs: fix the title identity first, find
  the one-probe gate behind the dialog strings, pre-seed the cache
  tree offline when the disc's descriptor format is a flat
  {size, path} manifest with uncompressed slices, and prove it with a
  cold boot judged by asset opens rather than the progress bar.
